          "kicker": "Training base",
          "heading": "Jake White's Fiji hold captain's run at Kirwan Park, not the Aviva",
          "body": "Fiji have trained at De La Salle Palmerston FC, the junior club known locally as 'Salmo', this week, and the squad has become part of the furniture. Their captain's run on Friday will be at Kirwan Park rather than the Aviva Stadium, and non-playing squad members train there again on Saturday morning. Forwards coach Gert Smal, once of Ireland, is watching the sessions with a keen eye. DLSP FC director of rugby Norman Byrne says: \"They're the nicest people you'll ever come across.\""
        },
