          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Borthwick restores Max Ojomoh to England's No. 12 shirt against Japan",
          "body": "Bath centre Max Ojomoh is back in England's No. 12 shirt after starring for the A team, having not played for his country since his man-of-the-match display against Argentina a year ago. England head coach Steve Borthwick says the position now demands more than skill: \"Max is one of the most talented players in English rugby,\" he said. Fly-half George Ford returns to the starting side, with Fin Smith left out."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "All Blacks name Beauden Barrett captain, Scott Barrett passed over",
