          "kicker": "Camp secrecy",
          "heading": "Galthié keeps Marcoussis camp closed to media before Springboks test",
          "body": "Marc Duzan of Rugbyrama reports that Rassie Erasmus, Springboks head coach, named his side on Monday, while France's Marcoussis camp this week was run behind closed doors with the press kept out. Duzan calls that almost unprecedented for Fabien Galthié, France head coach. Rugbyrama's request for an interview was refused, with the reply: \"C’est pas le bon moment.\""
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "All Blacks name Beauden Barrett captain, Scott Barrett passed over",
