          "kicker": "Captain's review",
          "heading": "Captain Giacomo Nicotera admits Italy gave away too many penalties against Sudafrica",
          "body": "Italy captain Giacomo Nicotera said the team was very critical of its performance after the 7-66 defeat to South Africa, which he called not sufficient. The review covered aerial play, defence, organisation and discipline, with too many penalties partly caused by South Africa's pressure at the breakdown. Nicotera described a hard review on Monday and a more demanding week in training. Ahead of Saturday's test against Argentina in Genoa, he said winning their own ball would be fundamental to getting more attacking possession."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "All Blacks name Beauden Barrett captain, Scott Barrett passed over",
