      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Gregor Townsend recalls Darcy Graham and Blair Kinghorn against Australia on Sunday",
          "body": "Two changes to Scotland's XV for Sunday's Nations Championship test with Australia at Murrayfield. Kinghorn takes the full-back jersey from Kyle Rowe, who is not in the squad, while Graham, 29, is on the left wing after a quicker-than-expected recovery from a bicep tear. Townsend has stressed \"individual responsibility\" after Scotland conceded seven tries in a 21-43 defeat to New Zealand. Ollie Leatherbarrow, who qualifies through his grandmother from Perth, could make his debut off the bench."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "All Blacks name Beauden Barrett captain, Scott Barrett passed over",
