          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Les Kiss restores Carter Gordon at fly-half, moves Suaalii to centre",
          "body": "Wallabies head coach Les Kiss has made three changes and two positional switches for the Scotland test at Murrayfield. Gordon replaces Declan Meredith at fly-half, returning from a fractured leg sustained in the 28-28 draw with Argentina in Mendoza in September. Joseph Suaalii, who has played on the wing in Australia's last four Tests, moves back to outside centre alongside Len Ikitau, replacing Isaac Henry. Rob Valetini is back in the starting XV on the blindside flank."
