          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Japan face Max Ojomoh and Henry Pollock as Borthwick rings the changes",
          "body": "England head coach Steve Borthwick is ringing the changes for Japan, and the Guardian's Robert Kitson picks out Max Ojomoh as the standout case. Ojomoh, 26, has not played for England since being voted player of the match against Argentina a year ago, and Kitson writes he would probably not be back at 12 without injuries to Seb Atkinson and Benhard van Rensburg. Henry Pollock, who scored two tries from the wing against Australia, is listed at No 8, though Kitson suggests his role could change."
