      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Dave Rennie names Beauden Barrett All Blacks captain, Scott Barrett passed over",
          "body": "Utility back Beauden Barrett captains the All Blacks in Cardiff, the first time the 148-Test player has skippered his country at Test level. New Zealand head coach Dave Rennie passed over Scott Barrett, the first-choice captain in 2024 and 2025, who starts at lock. Rennie said: \"I don't think he needs the extra responsibility,\" adding that Scott Barrett will be closer to the action and should talk to the referee where possible. Codie Taylor had captained after Ardie Savea's shoulder injury."
        },
