          "kicker": "Tactical plans",
          "heading": "Siya Kolisi says Springboks have no special plans for Antoine Dupont switch",
          "body": "Springboks captain Siya Kolisi told reporters on Thursday that South Africa's defensive structures will not change for France's Antoine Dupont, who has been selected at fly-half. \"Our system doesn't change for any team we play against,\" Kolisi said. Assistant coach Mzawandile Stick has confirmed the Boks have made no special plans to limit him, and Kolisi and Stick predict Dupont and scrum-half Maxime Lucu will job share throughout, both having played fly-half for their clubs."
        },
